  "display_title": "My Boyfriend I Hate",
  "description": "Inha was always compared to Yejun. Just as she was growing weary of the endless comparisons, she happened to receive an art award that brought her some attention, and so Inha began to pursue the path of art. Eight years later, she reunites with Yejun... only to find that he, too, is now doing art. Believing it's inevitable that she'll once again be compared to him, Inha starts making plans to distance herself from Yejun. A coming-of-age romance about Inha, who harbors a dislike for Yejun.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
